# Security

- Never commit `.env`, license keys, DB passwords, tokens, or webhook secrets. Only `*.example` placeholders.
- Treat all client/NUI/net input as untrusted.
- Use parameterized SQL only via `sync_db` (once it exists).
- Follow `docs/SECURITY.md` for anti-dupe and trust boundaries.
